'''Summon Bestial Snake''' is a [[spell]] that summons an allied [[Snake]] [[minion]]. The skill is solely available through {{il|page=Yriel's Fostering (Snake)}}. 

==Skill Functions and Interactions==
The summoned Bestial Snake fires projectiles dealing [[chaos damage]]. Like the other [[bestial minion]]s, the Bestial Snake's hits cannot be evaded.

==Acquisition==
Summon Bestial Snake can only be obtained by equipping {{il|page=Yriel's Fostering (Snake)}}.

